ACK_ID", "text": "Levelleri yeniden oynamaya ba\u015flad\u0131m sizin de\u011fi\u015fiklerle birlikte s\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131 var m\u0131 diye \u015fimdi 1-10'u bitirdim 100'e do\u011fru geliyorum", "channel": "CC43664F351E", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/CC43664F351E/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/32", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "74d2bb568a082c1265000bee035efdf9", "ts": "1756987090.956989", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "[USERNAME_58311]", "channel": "CC43664F351E", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/CC43664F351E/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/35", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "1921fdf6883da0165fb320fc90119152", "ts": "1756988412.713749", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Biraz daha iyiyim, d\u00fcn g\u00f6z\u00fcm\u00fc a\u00e7am\u0131yordum acayip bir ba\u015f a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131 falan", "channel": "CC43664F351E", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/CC43664F351E/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/36", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "7019c72365b1a2c6ccccc64118a7a253", "ts": "1756988432.575799", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "4'er saat arayla aferin'leri \u00e7ak\u0131nca kuyrdu\u011fu diktim, \u015fimdi sadece terliyorum :smile:", "channel": "CC43664F351E", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/CC43664F351E/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/42", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "dcf3113cb290c0abc6c520de794ead77", "ts": "1757006806.191829", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Tamamd\u0131r, hay\u0131rd\u0131r s\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131l\u0131 bi durum mu var?", "channel": "CC43664F351E", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/CC43664F351E/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/44", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "6118499fcebebd7e1a4beb8e540958c6", "ts": "1758558396.349789", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Playtest cloud videolar\u0131 inan\u0131lmaz sinir bozucu [USERNAME_31811]", "channel": "CC43664F351E", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/CC43664F351E/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/45", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "4a99a887f121e2fe04edcd62d58cb257", "ts": "1758558400.563689", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Siz ba\u015flad\u0131n\u0131z m\u0131 izlemeye", "channel": "CC43664F351E", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services